  "notes": "SUBSTITUTION: the LTM 1120-4.1 is no longer listed with a datasheet on liebherr.com (product page has no technical-data PDF); its successor LTM 1120-4.2 (current datasheet 03/2026) is used instead. The 120 t rating is over the rear only (12.3 m boom, 3 m); that over-rear '*' sub-column is excluded; 360° max here is 69.5 t. IMPORTANT: cells are colour-shaded by required VarioBallast radius (3.83 m light / 4.77 m dark) - not encoded here; check the source chart. Outrigger icon has no dimension; span from p.3 drawing: longitudinal 7481 mm (4454+3027; other side 7439 = 4716+2723), transverse 7006 mm (VarioBase 2512-7006). Max supporting force 600 kN (62 t) p.12 (other value 504 kN / 52 t). operatingWeight_t = on-road gross <=48 t (4 x 12 t) with 2.1 t counterweight (p.13). Max hook height not stated numerically for the T boom (cover/web 91 m incl. jib). Hook block weight is part of the load (Liebherr remarks). Telescopic boom: 1 base + 6 telescopic sections (p.4-5 spec text). Boom lengths omitted from source table: 53.5, 59.7, 61.2, 61.7, 63.1, 65.3 m."
